INSERT INTO `techfix_review` VALUES (1,4,'Does the job well','For the price, the Acer Aspire 5 has been a good buy. It starts up quickly, the keyboard is comfortable, and it handles my daily work and video calls without fuss. I would recommend it with minor caveats.','2025-06-05 19:43:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,1,24,1),(2,4,'Happy with it so far','I picked up the Acer Aspire 5 recently and I am pleased overall. It starts up quickly, the keyboard is comfortable, and it handles my daily work and video calls without fuss. A good option if you want something dependable.','2026-04-12 06:55:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,1,11,1),(3,3,'Does what it says','I have mixed feelings about the Acer Aspire 5. It manages light work fine, but it gets warm under load and I wish it had more ports. Fine for basic needs, though I would compare alternatives.','2025-09-03 02:21:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,1,29,1),(4,2,'A few letdowns','The Acer Aspire 5 works, but I expected better. It slows down with several apps open and the battery does not last as long as I hoped. I would think twice before buying it again.','2026-10-15 04:49:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,1,17,1),(5,3,'Does what it says','The Samsung Galaxy A55 does the basics, though it has a few rough edges. It manages light work fine, but it gets warm under load and I wish it had more ports. It gets the job done, but I would not call it exceptional.','2025-11-24 17:15:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,2,11,1),(6,4,'Happy with it so far','The Samsung Galaxy A55 arrived on time and has worked well since. It starts up quickly, the keyboard is comfortable, and it handles my daily work and video calls without fuss. A good option if you want something dependable.','2026-04-26 06:27:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,2,23,1),(7,4,'Pleased with this','The Samsung Galaxy A55 has been a solid purchase so far. It starts up quickly, the keyboard is comfortable, and it handles my daily work and video calls without fuss. Worth considering if the price fits your budget.','2026-05-21 19:14:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,2,29,1),(8,4,'Recommended','For the price, the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 has been a good buy. It starts up quickly, the keyboard is comfortable, and it handles my daily work and video calls without fuss. A good option if you want something dependable.','2025-05-20 22:28:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,3,11,1),(9,4,'Solid purchase','The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 has been a solid purchase so far. It starts up quickly, the keyboard is comfortable, and it handles my daily work and video calls without fuss. A good option if you want something dependable.','2025-05-14 07:29:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,3,14,1),(10,5,'Great everyday pick','I bought the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 for everyday use and it has been great. It starts up quickly, the keyboard is comfortable, and it handles my daily work and video calls without fuss. Overall, a great purchase.','2026-09-01 08:56:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,3,26,1),(11,4,'Good value','The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 arrived on time and has worked well since. It manages light work fine, but it gets warm under load and I wish it had more ports. A good option if you want something dependable.','2026-10-17 10:34:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,3,10,1),(12,3,'Okay overall','I have mixed feelings about the ASUS Vivobook 15. It manages light work fine, but it gets warm under load and I wish it had more ports. An acceptable choice if your expectations are modest.','2025-05-15 22:56:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,4,29,1),(13,2,'A few letdowns','I had higher hopes for the ASUS Vivobook 15. It slows down with several apps open and the battery does not last as long as I hoped. It might suit light use, but it was not right for me.','2025-10-26 08:57:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,4,12,1),(14,5,'Would buy again','After a month with the ASUS Vivobook 15, I am very happy with it. It starts up quickly, the keyboard is comfortable, and it handles my daily work and video calls without fuss. I would happily buy this again.','2025-07-19 12:27:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,4,20,1),(15,4,'Happy with it so far','The ASUS Vivobook 15 has been a solid purchase so far. It manages light work fine, but it gets warm under load and I wish it had more ports. Worth considering if the price fits your budget.','2026-08-06 04:00:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,4,24,1),(16,4,'Good value','The ASUS Vivobook 15 has been a solid purchase so far. It starts up quickly, the keyboard is comfortable, and it handles my daily work and video calls without fuss. Worth considering if the price fits your budget.','2026-07-31 15:00:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,4,26,1),(17,5,'Very happy with this','I\'ve been using the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro for a few weeks and it has been excellent. Calls are clear, everyday apps run smoothly, and the camera handles my usual photos well. It has earned a permanent place in my setup.','2025-11-13 20:27:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,5,16,1),(18,5,'Better than expected','I bought the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro for everyday use and it has been great. Calls are clear, everyday apps run smoothly, and the camera handles my usual photos well. Would recommend it to anyone looking for a dependable option.','2025-12-07 11:19:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,5,24,1),(19,4,'Does the job well','For the price, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro has been a good buy. Calls are clear, everyday apps run smoothly, and the camera handles my usual photos well. A good option if you want something dependable.','2026-02-09 14:53:31.184000','2026-10-31 06:49:31.471000',NULL,5,30,1),(20,4,'Happy with it so far','I have used the Samsung 24in Odyssey G3 Monitor regularly and it does what I need. The picture is sharp, colours look good, an