Magic Astra 2 Gaming Tablet (2026) for a few weeks and it has been excellent. The screen is bright, apps open quickly, and it is comfortable to hold for reading and streaming. Overall, a great purchase.','2026-04-12 20:11:28.447000','2026-11-06 13:44:28.529000',NULL,1273,17,1),(6028,5,'Really impressed','I bought the RedMagic Astra 2 Gaming Tablet (2026) for everyday use and it has been great. The screen is bright, apps open quickly, and it is comfortable to hold for reading and streaming. It has earned a permanent place in my setup.','2026-05-01 13:56:28.447000','2026-11-06 13:44:28.529000',NULL,1273,16,1);
