E','2026-10-17 13:17:28.515000','2026-10-17 13:17:28.515000',4,576),(484,'Fix HP Compaq LA2205wg (2011): Picture looks blurry','Text and images on the HP Compaq LA2205wg (2011) are soft or pixelated.','1. Set the resolution to the panel\'s native Full HD value.\n2. Raise the refresh rate to 60Hz or higher in display settings.\n3. Use a digital cable instead of VGA where possible.\n4. On old monitors, degauss and reset the picture defaults.','Easy','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pjQKLINQx8w','2026-10-17 13:17:28.543000','2026-10-17 13:17:28.543000',4,577),(485,'Fix HP Slate 7 (2013): Will not charge past 1%','The HP Slate 7 (2013) plugs in but the battery icon stays at 0-1 percent or shows a charging error.','1. Clean the charging port with a wooden pick and compressed air.\n2. Try a different cable and at least a 2A adapter.\n3. Leave it connected to power for 30 minutes before trying to boot.\n4. An inflated or dead battery must be replaced professionally.','Medium','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sYs5Hc0vK0g','2026-10-17 13:17:28.560000','2026-10-17 13:17:28.560000',4,578),(486,'Fix HP Compaq dc7800 (2008): Loud fan and random shutdowns','The HP Compaq dc7800 (2008) roars under load and powers off without warning.','1. Dust the filters, fans and heatsinks with compressed air.\n2. Reapply thermal paste on the CPU and GPU.\n3. Monitor temperatures with hardware monitoring software.\n4. Replace the PSU if voltages are unstable.','Medium','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kFkEM_8ylwY','2026-10-17 13:17:28.584000','2026-10-17 13:17:28.584000',4,579),(487,'Fix Lenovo ThinkPad T430 (2012): Not charging / no power light','The Lenovo ThinkPad T430 (2012) shows no charging LED and does not power on with the adapter connected.','1. Test the adapter on another laptop and check the pin for damage.\n2. Unplug the battery, hold Power for 30 seconds, then reconnect everything.\n3. Try a different wall outlet and inspect the DC jack for looseness.\n4. A loose jack or dead board 